            "notes": "This lucio build is centered around playing safe and keeping your team alive UNTIL Round 5 where you'll pick up on damage heavily whilst also keeping your heals high too.\n\nFor Round 1, we take [Sonic Boom](item_e0a58a96-c17f-4c99-ba06-8daaa5fd5508), this will transfer 30% of your damage into healing which can make a huge difference if you're shooting consistently. \n\nAlternatively, take [Mixtape](item_95c95a51-50f2-4ae3-850b-e2947a95b1ce) if you're playing against an Ana to make her nades a bit easier to cope with. You swap to speed boost whilst your team is anti'd and then swap back to healing after it ends to provide a nice healing burst. If you're running Mixtape also remember to just hold it on speed boost whilst not in fights and then swap to healing when your team is low which will provide MASSIVE healing boosts.\n\nThe only reason we take [Sonic Boom](item_e0a58a96-c17f-4c99-ba06-8daaa5fd5508) here over [Mixtape](item_95c95a51-50f2-4ae3-850b-e2947a95b1ce) is because it scales better into the build late-game.",
