            "created_at": "2025-08-31T15:12:30.51682+00:00",
            "notes": "For Round 2, we pick up [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) to improve survivability and make you a lot less squishier so that you're able to remain healing your team in somewhat dangerous positions without you getting annihilated.\n\nWe take [#1 Single](item_5c5d5331-2966-440b-b989-aa92187eef97) here as well to make our healing radius bigger, I've been running this build for a while and this seems to be the stronger item over AP boosters like [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6).\n\nIf you have spare money then buy an extra AP blue, feel free to sell your [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) to buy one if you're just shy of cash.",
