            "notes": "In Round 3, we pick up [Reverb](item_c973a6d8-47ee-4846-adb4-78f40c1b6a9f) as well as [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8). This will make you feel so much tankier. Every time you Boop/Amp It Up, you will regain 50 armor and having two charges of Boop just makes this insane; it's very common to see this in Lucio builds and there's a very good reason for it. Make sure to boop away any close range characters if they get close to your team (e.g Junker Queen about to swing her battleaxe or Reinhardt)",
