            "notes": "Round 5 is where this build really picks up like crazy.\n\nPick up  [Signature Shift](item_665f2250-6c78-439a-8ea8-6d5c8124e73c) for your 3rd power as this build centres around it.\n\nWe take [Three-tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429) & [Mark of the Kitsune](item_09a53e39-25aa-4f66-ba51-bedbc543a1eb) to do huge damage bursts to the enemies. \n\nWith this power and these items together, you will become crazy at insta-picking squishies. You boop them and then shoot a burst into them and repeat and the damage is ridiculous; playing this with a Winston/Genji that's coordinated with you will just mean no means of escape for your target although they're not even needed half the time.\n\nDespite your ability power feeling low, if you're running this with [Sonic Boom](item_e0a58a96-c17f-4c99-ba06-8daaa5fd5508) it'll more than make up for that decrease.",
